    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me under Section 2 of the Special Commodity Levy Act, No. 48 of 2007, I, MangalaSamaraweera, Minister of Finance of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka, do by this order impose in respectof the list of commodity specified in Column I of the Schedule hereto, a Special Commodity Levy at the rate specified inthe corresponding entry in Column II of that Schedule.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      490.09,
      539.9,
      513.16
    ],
    "text": "This Order shall be valid for a period of 03 months commencing from November 03, 2019, subject to provisionsof Sub Section (3) of Section 2 of the Special Commodity Levy Act, No. 48 of 2007.",
